  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Caixa Solid Waste Management and Carbon Finance Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project will support the creation of a Program within the Caixa Economica Federal do Brazil, through which Caixa will be able to identify, prepare and partially finance emission reduction activities under solid waste management projects and sell the resulting emissions reductions credits.</narrative>
